<p>Taking on a spectral form, you teleport to the target tile within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> </p><p>For 3 turns after using this spell, you gain the ability to instantly teleport back to your original tile as long as you are within range of it.</p>